[gd_resource type="SpriteFrames" format=3]

; The crew sprite with the helmet OFF (WI-67).
;
; The same seven animations as crew_suited_frames.tres, frame for frame, at the
; same speeds and loop flags - PawnBase.set_sprite_frames carries the current
; animation and frame index across a swap, so a mismatch would drop a walking
; pawn onto idle mid-stride (or onto nothing at all).
;
; Only crewBlueA has helmetless art, and it is the only crew set the game uses -
; every crew member is this sprite recoloured by WI-22's tint. Note that the tint
; falls on the face and hair here rather than on a suit, which is the one thing
; about this wardrobe that needs looking at rather than testing.

